- [ ] Request cannot make Ruby the authority for joints/drilling.
- [ ] Response is sufficient for atomic native rebuild without client orientation/thickness inference.
- [ ] Structured errors/codes are stable; UI behavior does not depend on localized message substrings.
- [ ] Stateless retries are deterministic and do not create business records.
- [ ] The contract has shared fixtures consumed by relevant TS/Go/Ruby tests.
- [ ] Auth capability is explicit and coordinated with #460.
- [ ] API/schema version mismatch fails before host mutation.

