## Objective

Provide a secure, explicit and user-friendly handoff between the React Project/Design workspace and Granete for SketchUp, so a user can connect or open the exact Project, Design and base revision without copying business IDs, reusing a web credential, trusting the `.skp` path or putting bearer tokens in URLs.

