## Missing ownership

#388 owns metadata binding inside a SketchUp model. #396 owns the Web workspace. #460 owns client-specific credentials. None currently owns the cross-product handoff itself:

```text
React Project/Design
→ choose “Abrir / conectar en SketchUp”
→ prove exact authorized context
→ SketchUp receives it securely
→ validate and persist model binding
```

Without an explicit contract, implementations tend to leak a web JWT into a custom URI, ask users to paste raw UUIDs or infer context from filenames.

