- `apps/sketchup-extension/AGENTS.md`
  - scoped mandatory instructions for agents working inside the extension;
  - identity/authority/undo/rollback/security/real-host rules.

## Backlog reconciliation performed outside this PR

Issue metadata/bodies were reconciled in parallel:

- created META #465;
- created shared foundations:
  - #476 — Semantic SelectionContext + capability-driven inspector;
  - #477 — versioned rich authoring resolve contract TS↔Go↔Ruby;
