## Critical boundary

> **SketchUp owns authoring/interaction; Granete owns manufacturing truth.**

This PR explicitly prohibits:

- local Ruby BOM/thickness/joint/drilling/postprocessing engines;
- direct editing of derived CNC holes as truth;
- business identity from names/GUID/persistent_id/geometry;
- host UX issues being closed by pure domain helpers only;
